    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it's like 2am here and our doctor's office is closed. he seems okay otherwise, just a bit fussy and warm to the touch. he's had a mild cold for a few days so maybe it's just some viral thing coming out? do you think it's worth driving him to the ER right now or can it probably wait until his pediatrician opens in the morning?",
